From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TheKit <thekit@disroot.org>
Date: Sun, 2 Aug 2026 22:02:10 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] WayDroidService: Save task snapshots and publish the task
 list

On each foreground change save the outgoing task's WMS snapshot
(the same source Android's recents uses, captured at transition
start) as raw RGBA for the hwcomposer to freeze cards with. When
nothing was recorded, take one on demand -- but only for a live task
on an interactive display: a forced capture during the display-off
transition deadlocked system_server into a watchdog kill.

Also publish live task IDs as waydroid.task_list so the hwcomposer
can close cards for dead tasks.

Change-Id: I8f22633722d9da57f24f28178e154dc264b89ca9
---
 .../platform/internal/WayDroidService.java    | 139 ++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 139 insertions(+)

diff --git a/lineage/lib/main/java/org/lineageos/platform/internal/WayDroidService.java b/lineage/lib/main/java/org/lineageos/platform/internal/WayDroidService.java
